From b94e4394e251f086793e0df54d16fbab70487856 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritvik <ritvik2014@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:06:36 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/38] render: glass borders

blur { border-glass <saturation>; border-light; border-shade; border-inactive }:
under each border ring, the frosted backdrop that is really there (xray, or
for xray-off windows a real-blur framebuffer capture), lit like a glass edge
inside a dark hairline, quieter for unfocused windows.
---
